    "body": "I'm seeing something similar:\r\n\r\n```\r\n/home/mcrowe via  via 🐍 v3.6.9 via 💎 via 💠 default \r\n❯ echo $STARSHIP_CONFIG\r\n/home/mcrowe/.config/starship.toml\r\n\r\n/home/mcrowe via  via 🐍 v3.6.9 via 💎 via 💠 default \r\n❯ ls -l .config | grep starship\r\n-rw-rw-r--  1 mcrowe mcrowe  1549 Mar 26 12:31 starship.toml\r\n\r\n/home/mcrowe via  via 🐍 v3.6.9 via 💎 via 💠 default \r\n❯ starship config\r\nthread 'main' panicked at 'Unable to locate editor in $PATH.: Custom { kind: NotFound, error: CannotFindBinaryPath }', src/configure.rs:274:10\r\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\r\n```",
